From: Stanislav Malyshev <stas@php.net>
Date: Mon Jun 20 23:58:26 2016 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] iFixed bug #72446 - Integer Overflow in gdImagePaletteToTrueColor() resulting in heap overflow

5.4 backport: https://github.com/shivammathur/php-src-backports/commit/9aa8200b4a459290ffdf4896dd125229fa5c0c6c
---
diff --git a/ext/gd/libgd/gd.c b/ext/gd/libgd/gd.c
--- a/ext/gd/libgd/gd.c
+++ b/ext/gd/libgd/gd.c
@@ -133,6 +133,10 @@ gdImagePtr gdImageCreate (int sx, int sy)
 		return NULL;
 	}
 
+	if (overflow2(sizeof(unsigned char *), sx)) {
+		return NULL;
+	}
+
 	im = (gdImage *) gdCalloc(1, sizeof(gdImage));
 
 	/* Row-major ever since gd 1.3 */
